{"id":"e002586cbe5331e7","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-cor-levy-stable-scaling.md","title":"Stable Scaling","display":"cor-levy-stable-scaling — Stable Scaling","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-levy-stable-scaling","aliases":["58-cor-levy-stable-scaling"],"display":"cor-levy-stable-scaling — Stable Scaling","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-stable-distribution.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-levy-stable-scaling"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-levy-stable-scaling</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-levy-stable-scaling — Stable Scaling"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0a20d5f74408674\" href=\"?note=d0a20d5f74408674\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md\">../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4932fa2e649322cf\" href=\"?note=4932fa2e649322cf\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-stable-distribution.md\">../batch14/58-df-stable-distribution.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\((\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (probability space), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=(X_t)_{t\\geq0}\">\\(X=(X_t)_{t\\geq0}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;\\alpha\\leq2\">\\(0&lt;\\alpha\\leq2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\stackrel d=\">\\(\\stackrel d=\\)</span> (equality in distribution)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\\)</span> (Lévy-process predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d0a20d5f74408674\" href=\"?note=d0a20d5f74408674\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md\">../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StableDistribution}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{StableDistribution}_S\\)</span> (real-valued stable-distribution predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4932fa2e649322cf\" href=\"?note=4932fa2e649322cf\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-stable-distribution.md\">../batch14/58-df-stable-distribution.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}levy-stable-scaling} \\vdash \\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,1)\\land\\operatorname{StableDistribution}_S(X_1,\\alpha)\\to\\forall c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists b_c\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(X_{ct}\\stackrel d=c^{1/\\alpha}X_t+t b_c\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}levy-stable-scaling} \\vdash \\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,1)\\land\\operatorname{StableDistribution}_S(X_1,\\alpha)\\to\\forall c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists b_c\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(X_{ct}\\stackrel d=c^{1/\\alpha}X_t+t b_c\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The cited stable-distribution atom is real-valued, so this corollary uses the one-dimensional Lévy-process signature rather than silently extending that predicate to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^d\">\\(\\mathbb R^d\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The drift correction <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t b_c\">\\(t b_c\\)</span> is retained for a general stable Lévy process; it vanishes under the usual strict-stability normalization.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0a20d5f74408674","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-stable-distribution.md","status":"resolved","id":"4932fa2e649322cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-stable-distribution.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0a20d5f74408674","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S$ (Lévy-process predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-stable-distribution.md","status":"resolved","id":"4932fa2e649322cf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{StableDistribution}_S$ (real-valued stable-distribution predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-stable-distribution.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"X=(X_t)_{t\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"0<\\alpha\\leq2","display":false},{"tex":"\\stackrel d=","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StableDistribution}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}levy-stable-scaling} \\vdash \\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,1)\\land\\operatorname{StableDistribution}_S(X_1,\\alpha)\\to\\forall c\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists b_c\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(X_{ct}\\stackrel d=c^{1/\\alpha}X_t+t b_c\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^d","display":false},{"tex":"t b_c","display":false}],"bytes":1399,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-cor-levy-stable-scaling.md|58-cor-levy-stable-scaling]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["d0a20d5f74408674","4932fa2e649322cf"]}